SDZE builds on the PINN framework of the Stochastic Taylor Derivative Estimator
(STDE), by Zekun Shi et al., NeurIPS 2024.

Upstream source: https://github.com/sail-sg/stde
Paper: Stochastic Taylor Derivative Estimator: Efficient Amortization for
Arbitrary Differential Operators.

SDZE: Zhangyong Liang and Huanhuan Gao.
Stochastic Dimension Zeroth-Order Estimator: Memory-Efficient and Stable
